; LowRider Klipper Simple v0.2 - maximum segment 10 mm
; Initial positioning from unknown machine location is not segmented.
; Preserves existing work zero. Router ON/OFF is MANUAL.
; Requires Mainsail PAUSE_BASE and RESUME. No automatic homing or probing.
; Operation 1 bounds mm: X -186.867..187.113 Y -77.355..76.403 Z -1.4..15
G90
G21
; When using Fusion for Personal Use, the feedrate of rapid
; moves is reduced to match the feedrate of cutting moves,
; which can increase machining time. Unrestricted rapid moves
; are available with a Fusion Subscription.
M400
RESPOND MSG="Check work zero and clearance. Turn router ON at 25000 RPM, then Resume."
PAUSE_BASE
